==English==
{{rfe}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{context|cytology|lang=en}} Of a cell, having a pair of each type of [[chromosome]], one of the pair being derived from the [[ovum]] and the other from the [[spermatozoon]]. Most [[somatic cell]]s of higher organisms are diploid.
# {{cx|crystallography|lang=en}} Of a certain [[symmetry]] [[class]] with 24 [[congruent]] [[irregular]] [[quadrilateral]] [[face]]s.

